OL,3,GNEWSAMan who texted victim 'I feel bad'
OL,4,Aafter violent rape is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who texted his victim "I feel
OL,7,Fbad" after a violent rape in Edinburgh
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for seven years and
OL,9,Fthree months.
OL,11,FAlquimedes Gabriel Duran Geraldino, a
OL,12,F35-year-old Venezuelan national, forced
OL,13,Fhis way into a woman's home on 3
OL,14,FJanuary 2024, before subjecting her to
OL,15,Fphysical and emotional abuse.
OL,17,FDuring the trial at the High Court in
OL,18,FEdinburgh, the jury heard that
OL,19,FGeraldino had punched the 28-year-old
OL,20,Fwoman in the face, leaving her with a
OL,21,Fbroken nose, before kicking her body.
OL,22,FHe then raped her.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
