OL,5,
OL,6,FThe woman, who cannot be named, told
OL,7,Fthe court that during the attack he had
OL,8,Fdescribed her as a "a street walker"
OL,9,Fand accused her of having "slept with
OL,10,Fhalf of Edinburgh".
